Two BGP sessions are established between the FortiGate and GCP Cloud Router.

GCP Cloud Router
       │
       ├── BGP Session 1 ── IPsec Tunnel 1 ── ISP1 ── FortiGate
       │
       └── BGP Session 2 ── IPsec Tunnel 2 ── ISP2 ── FortiGate

The VPN tunnel interfaces use GCP-assigned link-local addresses in the
169.254.X.X/30 range.
